{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33666","headline":"送李员外频之建州 · 林宽","name":"送李员外频之建州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"句践江头月，客星台畔松。\n爲郎久不见，出守暂相逢。\n鸟泊牵滩索，花空押号钟。\n远人思化切，休上武夷峰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"林宽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33666.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33666","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}